<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are occupying thousands of homes in Mexico City while the arrest of a Gulf Cartel leader has sparked riots and violence in northern Mexico. A mayor who fought cartels was assassinated and his son was later detained, prompting truckers to halt protests before resuming after dialogue with authorities. Federal agents have charged 24 individuals in Tennessee with a Sinaloa Cartel drug-trafficking operation and indicted a Mexican engineer for building a cross-border drug tunnel. A 7‑year-old American girl was among six dead in cartel violence in Matamoros, and an official was arrested for covering up the mayor's cartel-linked killing. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Imperial Valley Press Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPRHZmbFdoNTc3aWdtSFh2eDlpWWZQdHhaWmpxaUdWMmZtdzNUWFFsd21oLUI5NUc0NnNsckRoQl9qLVFQOUtvOWNMX29sLWNxRW13b01YREpqbFNMRzBwQWFmSC1Pbmo0cEU2UHBScklyUzUxaWlRRTlzRnRmUXE0LWUwLXhBZVhqdWFJNUwtcl9lYW1NWGQ4cHA1WFoyNkFPSmZlcGZMcnVYM1lvV3BB?oc=5&quot;&gt;KABB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxOWElGM0JoamVXdnRKQjhNZTdCdmV1V1ZVWVBqU3NVUHpVbUlSWHkyZ04zVmp3RmtOaWdyS0Y4X2ZSeFM5QXdFY2ctLWo4UXk2VC0tZ1JZNnRQRVZ1VlZ6UjR1U0YydE5Ea0hYa0gwU2tFSE83dEw3ajRBTDVOdlZDX19QVmFWUlJnZjdZOHdUd0hqVVpVLTY0VDdsZlhTLU5Vc09LazYwa2hncTdud0JaeFNV